{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14308","headline":"奉酬侍御家兄东洛闲居夜晴观雪之什 · 窦庠","name":"奉酬侍御家兄东洛闲居夜晴观雪之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳宫观与天齐，雪净云消月未西。\n清浅乍分银汉近，辉光渐觉玉绳低。\n绿醽乍熟堪聊酌，黄竹篇成好命题。\n应念武关山断处，空愁簿领候晨鸡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦庠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14308.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14308","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}